ou visible results without irritation. It’s an easy way to upgrade your skincare with a product that works deeply and gently.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEcUZKPVep_text","label":"ggEcUZKPVep_text","default":"<p>Absolutely! Sandalwood calms irritation and redness, while turmeric’s anti-inflammatory properties help reduce acne and blemishes. The mask gently exfoliates without drying out your skin, making it perfect even for sensitive skin.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0_I0iVQWl_text","label":"gg0_I0iVQWl_text","default":"<p>Many users notice brighter, smoother, and clearer skin within just one week of regular use. Continued use enhances skin tone, tightens pores, and reduces dark spots for lasting radiance.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4oST9URdT_text","label":"gg4oST9URdT_text","default":"<p>Yes! The formula balances and nourishes the skin, providing hydration without excess oil. It’s ideal for all skin types—dry, oily, combination, or sensitive.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQRItR6dDy_text","label":"ggQRItR6dDy_text","default":"<p>Yes, it’s free from parabens, sulfates, alcohol, and mineral oils. The natural ingredients offer gentle exfoliation and nourishment, making it safe for frequent use without irritation.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNRFTvk2j0_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggNRFTvk2j0_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0803/9700/9186/files/gempages_546167947945575666-7d8786f9-bb63-480c-86eb-c010c56bfd07.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNRFTvk2j0_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"ggNRFTvk2j0_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0803/9700/9186/files/gempages_546167947945575666-92ac2b5e-5802-41bf-9cb2-d14afc4171cc.png"}],
